    <item>
      <title>当投资者注视着关税时，欧洲股票上升</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/european-stocks-rise-as-investors-eye-some-respite-from-tariffs</link>
      <description><![CDATA[欧洲股票周一提高，因为投资者从任何新的关税中看到了一些喘息的机会，因为注意力转向第一季度的收入。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/european-stocks-rise-as-investors-eye-some-respite-from-tariffs</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 07:06:28 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>经济复苏后，巴基斯坦的汇款记录</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/pakistan-s-remittances-rise-to-record-after-economic-recovery</link>
      <description><![CDATA[巴基斯坦的汇款在三月份上升到了记录，这表明与国际货币基金组织的贷款计划的经济复苏有关。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/pakistan-s-remittances-rise-to-record-after-economic-recovery</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 06:56:54 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>随着ETF流入的记录，中国的股票救援如火如荼</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/china-s-stock-rescue-in-full-swing-as-etf-inflows-hit-record</link>
      <description><![CDATA[中国交易所交易的资金获得了创纪录的流入，随着国家支持的买家竭尽全力将市场抵抗唐纳德·特朗普的关税。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/china-s-stock-rescue-in-full-swing-as-etf-inflows-hit-record</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 06:45:47 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>日本超长收益率在拍卖中跳跃，额外的预算问题</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/japan-super-long-yields-rise-amid-auction-extra-budget-concerns</link>
      <description><![CDATA[日本超级政府债券收益率激增，因为人们担心即将进行的20年拍卖和补充预算。]]></description>
