    <item>
      <title>BISAT：全球经济衰退，较低的石油将影响黎巴嫩</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-14/bisat-global-recession-lower-oil-will-impact-lebanon-video</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在黎巴嫩正在进行的工作正在进行新政府的经济。该国采用了一项法律草案，以重组其银行业，以释放国际援助，以帮助其摆脱自2019年以来遭受的经济危机。  （来源：彭博）]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-14/bisat-global-recession-lower-oil-will-impact-lebanon-video</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 06:25:40 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>印度的眼睛包裹了六周内美国贸易谈判的关键方面</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/india-eyes-wrapping-key-aspects-of-us-trade-talks-in-six-weeks</link>
      <description><![CDATA[根据新德里官员的说法，印度将于周一与美国进行特定部门的贸易讨论，而南亚国家希望在六周内确定关键细节。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/india-eyes-wrapping-key-aspects-of-us-trade-talks-in-six-weeks</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 06:25:19 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>中国出口在与我们的关税冲击残废交易之前膨胀</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/chinese-exports-rise-ahead-of-us-tariffs-that-will-snarl-trade</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在本月美国对美国实施的大规模关税加息之前，中国的出口将在3月反弹，近记录的货物流向东南亚。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/chinese-exports-rise-ahead-of-us-tariffs-that-will-snarl-trade</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 03:07:24 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>当关税缓刑使贸易商有所缓解时，铜边缘更高</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/copper-edges-higher-as-tariff-reprieve-gives-traders-some-relief</link>
      <description><![CDATA[唐纳德·特朗普总统对某些产品的惩罚关税施加豁免后，铜占据了大多数金属的速度，越来越高。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/copper-edges-higher-as-tariff-reprieve-gives-traders-some-relief</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 02:57:39 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>日本的股票随着技术的上升，药物的征收暂停希望</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/japan-s-stock-futures-climb-after-us-electronic-tariffs-paused</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在美国对一些消费者小工具和东京为关税会谈的一些消费小工具暂停了税款之后，日本的股票攀升了，电子制造商张贴了收益。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/japan-s-stock-futures-climb-after-us-electronic-tariffs-paused</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 22:29:07 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>欧洲公司库存，转移生产到支撑关税</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-12/european-firms-stockpile-shift-production-to-brace-for-tariffs</link>
      <description><![CDATA[唐纳德·特朗普（Donald Trump）现在退出了他最陡峭的关税。但是，随着其他职责仍然存在，在美国开展业务将使欧盟公司变得更加昂贵。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-12/european-firms-stockpile-shift-production-to-brace-for-tariffs</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 12 Apr 2025 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
